{"mode":"words","text":"Če se učiš iz seznamov besed, se ne učiš jezika. Na tej strani lahko v živo vidiš, kako se to v nekaj sekundah drugače počuti: Primer besedila zgoraj je resnični prikaz aplikacije, ki ga lahko preizkusiš, to pojasnilo pa ti bo takoj prebrala glasovna sinteza v kakovosti maternega govorca, medtem ko se besede osvetljujejo. Z LinguaFlow se jezike učiš tako, kot to ima rad tvoj možgan: najprej razumeš, potem poslušaš, nato pa govoriš. Metoda, na kateri temelji, črpa navdih iz Birkenbihlove metode in obsega štiri korake: dekodiranje, aktivno poslušanje, pasivno poslušanje in vaje. Preizkusi jo – klikni na besedo zgoraj.","words":[{"s":0,"e":200},{"s":240,"e":320},{"s":360,"e":720},{"s":800,"e":960},{"s":1017,"e":1440},{"s":1500,"e":2000},{"s":2213,"e":2640},{"s":2667,"e":2720},{"s":2800,"e":3040},{"s":3120,"e":3680},{"s":4000,"e":4640},{"s":4660,"e":4720},{"s":4800,"e":5200},{"s":5240,"e":5520},{"s":5600,"e":5680},{"s":5720,"e":6000},{"s":6040,"e":6560},{"s":6608,"e":6800},{"s":6853,"e":6960},{"s":7013,"e":7120},{"s":7160,"e":7200},{"s":7240,"e":7440},{"s":7520,"e":8080},{"s":8128,"e":8640},{"s":8700,"e":9200},{"s":9371,"e":10400},{"s":10440,"e":10880},{"s":10960,"e":11440},{"s":11547,"e":11760},{"s":11800,"e":12240},{"s":12280,"e":12720},{"s":12760,"e":13840},{"s":13867,"e":13920},{"s":13973,"e":14080},{"s":14100,"e":14320},{"s":14380,"e":15280},{"s":15520,"e":16000},{"s":16053,"e":16720},{"s":16827,"e":17040},{"s":17067,"e":17120},{"s":17173,"e":17280},{"s":17320,"e":17600},{"s":17640,"e":18080},{"s":18107,"e":18560},{"s":18608,"e":19360},{"s":19480,"e":19600},{"s":19640,"e":20240},{"s":20300,"e":20800},{"s":20853,"e":21440},{"s":21620,"e":22240},{"s":22293,"e":22400},{"s":22453,"e":22560},{"s":22620,"e":22960},{"s":23040,"e":23920},{"s":24520,"e":25120},{"s":25168,"e":25840},{"s":25973,"e":26240},{"s":26293,"e":26640},{"s":26680,"e":26960},{"s":27040,"e":27560},{"s":27610,"e":27760},{"s":27840,"e":28000},{"s":28060,"e":28240},{"s":28280,"e":28